WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.504 --> 00:00:10.704
Hello! Welcome to Cosmogeek Solutions. Today we will explain our WhatsApp Automation service.

2
00:00:10.992 --> 00:00:19.224
In India, most customers prefer sending a WhatsApp message over filling a form or making a call.

3
00:00:19.512 --> 00:00:30.768
But when these messages land on personal phones, replies are delayed and leads are lost. This is where WhatsApp Automation helps.

4
00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:34.272
Let us look at the problems first.

5
00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:39.000
Customers waiting too long for a first reply.

6
00:00:39.288 --> 00:00:45.024
Leads and support requests getting lost across personal phones and spreadsheets.

7
00:00:45.312 --> 00:00:51.096
Staff typing the same answers and routine updates manually, again and again.

8
00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:58.392
And no clear way to pass a conversation from automated replies to a team member.

9
00:00:59.088 --> 00:01:06.384
Now look at a real conversation. A customer sends Hi to your business number.

10
00:01:06.672 --> 00:01:15.576
A welcome message and menu go out instantly: products, prices, booking, or talking to the team.

11
00:01:15.864 --> 00:01:23.376
The customer chooses booking, and the bot asks for their name, requirement and preferred time.

12
00:01:23.664 --> 00:01:30.360
The booking is confirmed, and the lead is saved to your CRM automatically.

13
00:01:30.648 --> 00:01:39.672
And if the customer wants to talk to a person, the conversation reaches your team with its full history.

14
00:01:40.368 --> 00:01:43.896
Our service includes all of this.

15
00:01:44.184 --> 00:01:52.128
Setup of the official WhatsApp Business Platform, with a verified business profile and message templates.

16
00:01:52.416 --> 00:02:00.312
Conversation flows such as welcome menus, FAQs, product catalogues and lead qualification.

17
00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:08.904
Order, payment, appointment and delivery notifications, with customer permission, that is, opt-in.

18
00:02:09.192 --> 00:02:15.120
Integration with your CRM, website forms or order system.

19
00:02:15.408 --> 00:02:21.576
Human handoff, so a team member can take over the conversation when needed.

20
00:02:21.864 --> 00:02:26.352
And delivery, response and conversion reports.

21
00:02:27.048 --> 00:02:30.288
The setup process is simple too.

22
00:02:30.576 --> 00:02:39.888
First, we understand your customers' common questions and journeys, and decide where a person must respond.

23
00:02:40.176 --> 00:02:46.992
Then we design templates, branching logic and handoffs with consent in mind.

24
00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:53.976
After that, we connect WhatsApp to your website, CRM or order system.

25
00:02:54.264 --> 00:03:00.072
Testing with real scenarios, template approval, and then launch.

26
00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:05.856
And after launch, we keep improving the flows based on the data.

27
00:03:06.552 --> 00:03:16.896
For this, we use the WhatsApp Business Platform, WhatsApp Cloud API, Node.js, webhooks and CRM integrations.

28
00:03:17.184 --> 00:03:25.632
Using the official API keeps your business number safe and follows WhatsApp's policies.

29
00:03:26.328 --> 00:03:28.632
The benefits are clear.

30
00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:33.840
Every customer gets an instant first reply, day or night.

31
00:03:34.128 --> 00:03:40.728
No lead is lost, because every inquiry is captured and routed to the right person.

32
00:03:41.016 --> 00:03:46.296
Routine updates go out automatically, saving staff time.

33
00:03:46.584 --> 00:03:52.872
And the whole team works from one business number, with full context.

34
00:03:53.568 --> 00:04:06.696
Lead capture and follow-up, order and delivery updates, appointment reminders, payment reminders and support FAQs are the most popular use cases.

35
00:04:06.984 --> 00:04:16.152
It is very useful for retail, real estate, healthcare, education, food delivery and service businesses.

36
00:04:16.848 --> 00:04:25.872
Want to turn your WhatsApp into a smart sales and support channel? Talk to Cosmogeek Solutions.

37
00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:33.552
Click Start a Project, or message us directly on WhatsApp. Thank you!
